  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Peel potato, then cut into large chunks.\n• Thinly slice leek.\n• Finely chop carrot.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6851075906685a8854e6b389/step-fee57600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cook potato in the boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 10-15 minutes. Drain and return potato to the saucepan.\n• Add the plant-based milk and a generous drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper, then mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6851075906685a8854e6b389/step-5dc3c310.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate to rest.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook leek and carrot, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add plant-based butter, garlic paste, Mumbai spice blend, mild North Indian spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 2 minutes.\n• Add lentils, vegetable stock powder, coconut milk, the water and brown sugar. Stir and simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes. Season with pepper to taste. Stir through baby spinach leaves until wilted, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6851075906685a8854e6b389/step-cd236120.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. Transfer lentil filling to a baking dish, then top with potato mash.\n• Run a fork over mash to create an uneven surface. Sprinkle with brown mustard seeds and drizzle with olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6851075906685a8854e6b389/step-a9ae9330.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grill pie until lightly browned, 10-15 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6851075906685a8854e6b389/step-1dd05c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide Indian lentil, haloumi and veggie curry pie with mustard seed mash topping between plates to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6851075906685a8854e6b389/step-2faee150.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
